World "Bilinear"
Title "Bilinear World"


Introduction "
Welcome to the Bilinear World! You may not know what a bilinear product is, but you're likely familiar with inner products such as the dot product, commonly used for calculating the angle between vectors. Inner products are slightly more restricted and as such, slightly more powerful but oh well.

In this world we don't (yet!) assign a function to be our bilinear product, instead we assume three fundamental properties of a bilinear product (inner products require a fourth) and use these \"axioms\" to reason about the properties of bilinear products.
"
